== 静态校验 ==
$ python3 -m py_compile sim_adapter.py → PY_COMPILE-OK
$ python3 sim_adapter.py --selfcheck
[selfcheck] |acc|误差峰值=0.0000(≤0.05) |w|峰值=0.000000(<0.01) 点云布局=True zcut剔除=True → PASS（exit 0）
$ xml.dom.minidom.parse(95_sim.launch) → XML-OK
$ roslaunch --nodes lite3_drivers 95_sim.launch rviz:=false use_gpu:=false → /mockamap_node /pcl_render_node /sim_adapter
$ yaml.safe_load(faster_lio_sim.yaml) → extrinsic_est_en=False blind=0.2 time_scale=1e3 lidar_type=2

